          "id": "a",
          "text": "15 J"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "30 J"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "150 J"
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "5 J"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "c",
      "explanation": {
        "text": "The gain is the weight times the height, so U = mg h = 5 x 10 x 3 = 150 J.",
        "inline": []
